A(('table', dict(key='auc', caption='Predictive value (AUC) of constraint-difference features for single-agent failure', header=['Error model', 'Failure rate', 'AUC, load', 'AUC, region size', 'AUC, changed constraints'], rows=rows, widths=[3000, 1200, 1400, 1600, 1500], font_half_points=16, note='AUC = 0.5 means no predictive value. Computed on the test split (6,000 episodes per error model).')))
A(('p', f"""Features of the constraint difference carried a modest but consistent signal under per-check slips, with AUC between {E.capture(min((A_(f, 'eps', e) for f in ('load', 'region_proxy', 'changed') for e in (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.04))), "build_manuscript.py:124: min((A_(f, 'eps', e) for f in ('load', 'region_proxy', 'changed') for e in (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.04)))", f'.2f', -1)} and {E.capture(max((A_(f, 'eps', e) for f in ('load', 'region_proxy', 'changed') for e in (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.04))), "build_manuscript.py:124: max((A_(f, 'eps', e) for f in ('load', 'region_proxy', 'changed') for e in (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.04)))", f'.2f', -1)} ({{T:auc}}). When error rates themselves depended on region size, the AUC rose to {E.capture(A_('load', 'loaded', 0.005), "build_manuscript.py:124: A_('load', 'loaded', 0.005)", f'.2f', -1)}–{E.capture(A_('region_proxy', 'loaded', 0.005), "build_manuscript.py:124: A_('region_proxy', 'loaded', 0.005)", f'.2f', -1)}. In the size-independent control it was {E.capture(A_('load', 'flat', 0.3), "build_manuscript.py:124: A_('load', 'flat', 0.3)", f'.2f', -1)}–{E.capture(A_('region_proxy', 'flat', 0.3), "build_manuscript.py:124: A_('region_proxy', 'flat', 0.3)", f'.2f', -1)}, below 0.5: a single overlooked check is more likely to be decisive when the region is small and every check matters, so larger regions are slightly safer in that model. Predictive value is conditional on how check opportunities and their consequences depend on structure; this simulator does not establish a universal weakness of structural signals."""))
A(('figure', dict(key='risk', path=os.path.join(FIG, 'fig1_risk_signal.png'), width_cm=15.5, caption='Single-agent failure against the constraint-difference load (left) and AUC of the three features under each error model (right).', alt='Line chart of failure rate by load and bar chart of AUC by error model')))
